starlight-weapon-open-2 = There are signs of frequent use on the grip.
starlight-weapon-open-3 = Custom modifications suggest a particular owner.
starlight-weapon-open-4 = It is battle-worn, but still reliable.
starlight-weapon-open-5 = This is an old piece that has been well maintained.

